   "text": "The seats show moderate wear. The carpet shows normal wear consistent with age and mileage. The headliner shows miscellaneous smudge marks from normal use. The inner door panels and interior trim showed the age and mileage of the vehicle. I noted no smoke or odd odors. The interior electronics and climate controls worked. The windows, locks, and mirrors all functioned. The gauges worked."
